GFOpenTorrent: the file list and the About box without Windows.
FileStorageModel shows the toolkit's folder and file icons
(wxArtProvider) in place of the shell's, and every extension the file
icon; the About box has no OpenSSL row, as libtorrent is built without
OpenSSL here. Each change sits under __WXOPENLAYOUT__, Windows' code as
it was.
